+### Every drawing value is here
+
+Every colour, line width, dash, opacity, font size and label offset the map and its panels draw
+with is a constant in this panel; none is written into the drawing code. A gist that does not set
+one draws the shipped look, because each default is the value the app has always used. A test,
+`no-static-draw-values.spec.js`, fails on a drawing value written as a literal, and on a key the
+code reads that is not registered.
